" value="7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;startArrow=block;startSize=8;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="wrk" target="inf"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="reg" target="inf"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="wrk" target="pub"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pub" target="hub"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;startArrow=block;startSize=8;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="hub" target="fs"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pub" target="ver"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="sto" target="ver"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="14" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ver" target="gem"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.9;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="hub" target="own"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="345" y="618"/><mxPoint x="345" y="825"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15b" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.9;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="hub" target="stf"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="345" y="618"/><mxPoint x="345" y="955"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.667;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="edg" target="hub"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_t" value="&lt;b&gt;Chú thích mũi tên&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1060" width="300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_l" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;  Camera/NVR đưa luồng phụ RTSP cho cổng phát luồng trong quán&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;  Cổng phát luồng đẩy H.264 lên cloud qua TLS (đóng gói lại, không giải mã)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;  Điện thoại làm camera gửi JPEG qua WebSocket thẳng lên cloud (nét đứt: lựa chọn)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;  Cổng nhận chuyển luồng cho khâu tiền xử lý&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;  Giải mã, lấy mẫu, đặt khung vào hàng khung (khung thô chỉ nằm trong RAM)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;  Worker camera kéo khung mới nhất của camera mình phụ trách&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;  Worker gọi suy luận GPU theo lô (gRPC), nhận khung xương, hộp, xác suất&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;  Dịch vụ suy luận nạp engine TensorRT từ kho model" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1090" width="760" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_r" value="&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;   Worker làm mờ mặt rồi phát sự kiện và ảnh bằng chứng lên Pub/Sub&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;  Hub đọc sự kiện từ Pub/Sub, chia việc cho nhân viên&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;  Hub ghi việc, bàn, nhật ký vào Firestore (nhiều instance dùng chung)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt;  Verifier nhận sự kiện cần xác minh từ Pub/Sub&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;13&lt;/b&gt;  Verifier đọc ảnh bằng chứng (đã làm mờ) từ Cloud Storage&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;14&lt;/b&gt;  Verifier gọi Gemini qua Vertex AI; báo trước, xác nhận hoặc huỷ sau&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;15&lt;/b&gt;  Hub đẩy kết quả (SSE) cho chủ quán và nhân viên; quán chỉ nhận kết quả&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;16&lt;/b&gt;  Chế độ edge: GPU tại quán tự suy luận, gửi sự kiện theo hợp đồng /api/edge/* (như demo)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="1090" width="750" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_n" value="&lt;b&gt;Viền liền, nền màu:&lt;/b&gt; đã có trong IaC demo (hub và verifier đang gộp trong một service easy-fnb). &lt;b&gt;Viền đứt, nền trắng:&lt;/b&gt; thiết kế đích, ngoài phạm vi IaC demo. Icon: bộ icon Google Cloud của draw.io (Vertex AI dùng icon AI Platform, hàng khung dùng icon Memorystore)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5f6368;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1280" width="1530" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>